    "title": "5 NASCAR race winners in 2025 yet to visit Victory Lane in 2026 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dominic Aragon ,\n12 hours ago\nEntering the 2026 NASCAR Cup Series season finale at Homestead-Miami Speedway, five drivers who won races last year are still seeking their first victory of 2026. Josh Berry, Ross Chastain, Austin Cindric, Austin Dillon, and Bubba Wallace remain winless entering this weekend at Homestead. Cindric is the highest in points...\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
